From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: David Cemin <dcemin@nvidia.com>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 21:31:15 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] NVIDIA: SAUCE: soundwire: mediatek: move the manager into its
 own directory

BugLink: https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2166301

Move the MediaTek SoundWire manager sources from drivers/soundwire/ into
drivers/soundwire/mediatek/, matching how the other vendor managers are
laid out and making room for the MT8901 clock-control glue that follows.
No functional change.

